<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Lee, remember this carefully…</i></b></font>

207
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:56,630
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Physical strength over endurance!</i></b></font>

208
00:10:57,090 --> 00:10:58,880
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Physical strength over endurance!</i></b></font>

209
00:10:59,300 --> 00:11:01,470
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Physical strength over endurance?</b></font>

210
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:03,470
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>And don't forget…Hyuga.</i></b></font>

211
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:05,510
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What? H-Hey wait, Neji!</b></font>

212
00:11:05,970 --> 00:11:08,310
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I thought you appeared
