215
00:11:12,350 --> 00:11:13,360
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Oh…</b></font>

216
00:11:14,560 --> 00:11:15,690
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Neji!</b></font>

217
00:11:15,770 --> 00:11:16,730
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Neji?!</b></font>

