237
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:12,830
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Oh, that sounds terrible…</b></font>

238
00:12:12,830 --> 00:12:15,170
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>At this rate,
