248
00:12:39,820 --> 00:12:41,440
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Oh, no such thing…</b></font>

249
00:12:41,860 --> 00:12:44,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Actually,
I've never had a chance</b></font>

250
00:12:44,280 --> 00:12:46,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>to talk like this
to a friend of Naruto's.</b></font>

251
00:12:47,490 --> 00:12:49,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Thanks to his upcoming wedding,</b></font>

252
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:51,330
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I got to talk to you
and the others,</b></font>

253
00:12:51,410 --> 00:12:57,210
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>and you've shown me a valuable side
of Naruto I never knew.</b></font>

254
00:12:57,710 --> 00:12:58,920
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'm grateful for that.</b></font>

255
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:02,260
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Now that I think about it,
since he graduated,</b></font>

256
00:13:02,340 --> 00:13:06,680
