257
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:08,640
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Is that so?!</b></font>

258
00:13:08,850 --> 00:13:09,390
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Huh?</b></font>

259
00:13:09,510 --> 00:13:11,140
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Why so shocked?</b></font>

260
00:13:11,520 --> 00:13:13,850
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I thought I could ask for your help</b></font>

261
00:13:13,850 --> 00:13:16,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>HA HA HA HA HA

with ideas for
Naruto's wedding gift.</b></font>

262
