<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>HA HA HA HA HA


Sorry, I'm no help.</b></font>

263
00:13:20,520 --> 00:13:24,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>But considering the effort
you're putting into finding a gift,</b></font>

264
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:27,530
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I know Naruto will be happy,
