299
00:14:53,910 --> 00:14:56,490
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>HOT-BLOODED

First, it can't be
something common.</b></font>

300
00:14:56,490 --> 00:14:59,120
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>HOT-BLOODED

But it mustn't be
too unconventional.</b></font>

